From recent events, Midranda seems to want to destroy us from within. I wonder whether he has not fully recovered yet.

With the information you brought, I believe we can use the Faugn in our plans. This creature's wish to protect its habitat is so strong that it can break free of Midranda's control from time to time.
We need to study it.

Please, go to the Sanctuary of the Abyss and collect the Faugn Tentacle by hunting the Insane Faugn.

I will be waiting for you.
